''ku'' has four uses:
# ((elidable terminator)) for a description beginning with LE or LA (but not LA+name)
# ((elidable terminator)) for quantifier+selbri description like ''ro remna'' (which is just a short form of ''ro lo remna'')
# ((elidable terminator)) for a free-floating tense (''puku'', ''kiku'') or modal (''baiku'')
# part of a ((naku)) compound
